---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="About A-1 Drain Cleaning | Mason City Iowa"
  description="Learn about A-1 Drain Cleaning, a local Mason City, Iowa drain and sewer service business serving North Iowa."
  path="/about/"
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-slate-950 py-14 text-white sm:py-20">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-300">A-1 Drain Cleaning • Mason City, Iowa</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black leading-[.98] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">A local drain cleaner in Mason City, Iowa</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200 sm:text-xl">A-1 focuses on drain cleaning and sewer work: clearing clogged drains, opening main lines, cutting roots, and finding out what is happening when a line keeps backing up.</p>
        <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="call-button mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-7 py-4 text-center text-lg font-black text-white shadow-lg hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="container grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <article>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">The work</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">What A-1 does</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">The work ranges from a stopped kitchen sink or toilet to a main sewer line that is sending wastewater back through a basement floor drain. Cable drain machines, sewer cameras, locating equipment, root-cutting equipment, and hydro-jetting are used when they fit the problem.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Local business</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Based in Mason City</h2>
          <address class="mt-4 not-italic text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning<br>206 29th St SW<br>Mason City, Iowa 50401</address>
          <a href="/service-area/" class="mt-5 inline-block font-black text-[#b4232b]">See the North Iowa service area →</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-100 py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Drain problems</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">The location of the water tells part of the story.</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Basement</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-600">A floor drain filling when the washer or another fixture runs can point to a larger drain restriction.</p></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Kitchen</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-600">A slow or stopped sink can be a fixture drain problem or part of a restriction farther down the line.</p></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Bathroom</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-600">Sinks, tubs, showers and toilets can clog from normal buildup or a larger drain-line restriction.</p></article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Main sewer</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-7 text-slate-600">Several fixtures backing up together can indicate a blockage farther down the main line.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ContactCTA />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</MainLayout>
